Package: tesserafin-server
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Tesserafin Project <https://github.com/tesserafin-project/tesserafin>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE_KB@
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgcc-s1, libfontconfig1, fonts-dejavu-core, libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu71 | libicu70 | libicu67, libssl3t64 | libssl3 | libssl1.1
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/tesserafin-project/tesserafin
Description: Tesserafin media server
 Tesserafin is a self-hosted media server. This package installs the server
 application, the bundled Tesserafin Web client and a systemd service that runs
 it as the unprivileged "tesserafin" user.
 .
 The application payload is a self-contained .NET build, so no system .NET
 runtime is required. The Tesserafin FFmpeg runtime, built from source at a
 pinned commit, is bundled with its own shared libraries and is the only encoder
 the service uses; it never falls back to an ffmpeg found on $PATH.
 .
 The server is GPL-2.0-or-later. The bundled FFmpeg runtime is GPL-3.0-or-later.
 See /usr/share/doc/tesserafin-server/copyright for the per-component breakdown,
 and /usr/share/doc/tesserafin-server/FFMPEG-CORRESPONDING-SOURCE.txt for the
 corresponding-source archive distributed alongside this package.
 .
 Server commit: @VCS_REF@
 Bundled Tesserafin Web commit: @WEB_VCS_REF@
 FFmpeg runtime: @F0_BUILD_REVISION@ (@F0_UPSTREAM_COMMIT@)
